The directory wgpu-hal is the complete crate archive extracted with its
single leading directory removed. Upstream MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses,
Cargo.toml.orig and .cargo_vcs_info.json are retained unchanged.
Only src/gles/egl.rs differs: Android prefers the advertised
EGL_EXT_create_context_robustness attribute over the EGL 1.5 core attribute.
Android without EXT and non-Android retain the upstream selection.
No robustness disabling, context retry or backend change is added.
